  "description": "A multitalented mixed-road machine. We pair fat but fast rolling tyres and suspension fork for comfort on a robust aluminium frame with the power of a Bosch CX drive unit and 600 Wh battery for go-anywhere ability.\n\nThe eFLOAT CC 400 EQ offers an incredibly versatile e-bike at a great price. Combining our robust aluminium frame and a powerful Bosch CX drive unit plus 600 Wh battery with fat 2.4\" fast-rolling tyres on 29\" wheels and a 120 mm suspension fork means this is an e-bike that's happy to explore off the beaten track. Whether you're in the city or exploring the forest, quality kit from Shimano and SR Suntour will get you safely there and back.\n\nWhen life is busy, you need a bike that will help you get the most out of your time. Whether you’re getting to work, taking a cross-town shopping trip or escaping it all to recharge your batteries at the weekend, the MERIDA eFLOAT CC lineup has a bike for you. An e-bike is an incredibly versatile tool for work or play - but the eFLOAT CC lineup is more versatile than most thanks to practical and versatile frame designs paired with strong and supportive Bosch drive systems; each will give you more time to do the things that matter. Offering real SUV-style specification, all bikes come with mudguards, a rear rack, a kickstand, a built-in lock, plus front and rear lights as standard, and each bike has a mid step through frame option if you need more clearance. We also use our sleek WIRE PORT cable routing system as standard, so the bikes look as good as they ride. By combining our expertise in aluminium frame design with Bosch’s refined and powerful drive systems, numerous battery options and intuitive display units, an fit for purpose specifications we’ve created an extensive eFLOAT CC range to suit your needs.",
